{
  "id": "GarrixScraping001",
  "name": "Garrix - 1. Collecte des offres",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "95f6d7b3-10a5-502d-b6af-f920e563bae8",
      "name": "Note 454c2b1b",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Collecte des offres\n1. Lit les sources actives (FastAPI)\n2. `fetch_mode=backend` : FastAPI lit la source avec son adapter (API, RSS, HTML autorisé)\n3. `fetch_mode=n8n` : n8n télécharge le flux RSS, le convertit, puis l'envoie à FastAPI\n4. FastAPI : normalisation → validation → déduplication → enregistrement → matching → notification (si score ≥ seuil de l'utilisateur)",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "09d5a487-e126-588a-a486-401829f86339",
      "name": "Toutes les 3 heures",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 3
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "379b0181-f6d4-523f-8fc5-ecfc62edffd7",
      "name": "Lancer manuellement",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
